            Hello! This is Kealozim - 18th circle Necromancer on the Fennin Ro server. I would like to present a new GREAT guild called The Lost Souls! The Lost Souls is dedicated to good fun, great friends, and lots more! Zebansis will be leading the guild, he is a great guy, fun to talk to. We also would like to ask any young and old interested in joining our ranks to please give us a hollar! We assure you, you will get the full enjoyment of your Everquest gaming experience! We are not a very strict guild but there are a few things that we will not tolerate. We severely frown upon begging for items/pp/powerleveling. If you need any help just ask and well, you shall receive(if it is within our abilities). We are trying to recruit dedicated players to join us. So please if you would like to join us please give Kealozim, Zebansis or Xearaeo a hollar on the Fennin Ro server! Our web page is http://www.geocities.com/eqthelostsouls as of this time it is not finished but we are hoping to get to up and runnin soon! See ya in the game! <br>
